SUMMARY:Lavazza
DESCRIPTION:Lavazza\, the premium coffee brand and Official Coffee Partner of TIFF\, is bringing festival excitement to Union Station with a free pop-up inspired by Florence’s historic wine windows. \nStep up to the theatre-inspired service window and ring the bell to reveal a surprise. You could walk away with a coffee sample\, branded merchandise or another exciting prize! \nWHAT: Lavazza Pop-Up at Union Station\nWHERE: Union Station (65 Front St. W.\, Toronto\, ON M5J 1E6)\nWHEN: September 13–15\, 2026 \n\nSunday\, September 13: 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. and 4 to 7 p.m.\n\nMonday\, September 14 and Tuesday\, September 15: 8 to 11 a.m. and 3 to 7 p.m.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/lavazza/2026-09-13/
LOCATION:GO Bay Concourse
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/SpringMorrisPhoto_UnionStationAugust2021_BayConcourseOpening-36-scaled.jpg
