SUMMARY:Anua
DESCRIPTION:Anua is popping up at Union Station to celebrate the launch of its newest VITA C skincare lineup! Stop by the Foodie Aisle to explore the new products\, learn more about Anua and its approach to skincare\, and discover how VITA C can fit into your daily routine.\n \nGuests will have the opportunity to interact with the products\, learn more about the ingredients and benefits behind the new collection\, and receive complimentary Anua samples while supplies last.\n \nWhether you’re already an Anua fan or discovering the brand for the first time\, come by\, experience the new VITA C lineup\, and find your newest skincare essential.\n \nWednesday\, September 16th: 10am – 7pm\n \nThursday\, September 17th: 8am – 7pm\n \nFree to attend. Samples available while supplies last.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/anua/2026-09-16/
LOCATION:Foodie Aisle
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Anua.png
END:VEVENT
